# Skill: AdvancedSearch
Description: Search, filter, and sort tasks using multiple criteria.
Tool: search_todos(user_id, q="deploy", priority="high", tag="work", sort_by="due_date")
Purpose: Find specific tasks among many using keyword, priority, tag, date range, and sorting.
Usage: "Search for urgent work tasks" -> search_todos(priority="urgent", tag="work").
Endpoint: GET /api/tasks/search
Filters: q (keyword ILIKE), priority (exact), is_complete (bool), tag (ILIKE), due_before, due_after.
Sort fields: created_at, updated_at, due_date, priority. Orders: asc, desc.
